.git
.gitignore
.next
node_modules
npm-debug.log
.env*

# The container generates its own Linux Prisma client via `npm ci`'s
# `postinstall` (`prisma generate`). Never ship a host-generated copy into
# the build context — `COPY . .` would otherwise overwrite the fresh
# container-built client with whatever platform generated this checkout.
generated

# Docs, tickets, and test artifacts the build never reads.
docs
roadmap
tests
test-results
.github
.claude
open-format
*.md
